; Move the picture pen left one pixel
;
; Subtracts 1 from the pen x. At the left edge (x 0) the pen stays and Z is
; returned. H is used as scratch; A is kept.
;
; D Pen x
; O:D New pen x
; O:F Z if the pen was at the edge and did not move
; O:H Destroyed
@label=MovePenLeft
c$8148 DEC D         ;
 $8149 LD H,A        ;
 $814A LD A,D        ;
 $814B CP $FF        ;
 $814D LD A,H        ;
 $814E RET NZ        ;
 $814F INC D         ;
 $8150 RET           ;
